<title>ITALY: BOXING-CIARLANTE WINS EURO SUPER-WELTER CROWN.</title>
<headline>BOXING-CIARLANTE WINS EURO SUPER-WELTER CROWN.</headline>
<dateline>CAGLIARI, Sardinia 1996-12-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's Davide Ciarlante captured the European super-welterweight boxing title on Friday when he unanimously outpointed defending champion Maouzi Hattab of France over 12 scheduled rounds.</p>
</text>
